# Edge cases derived by hand from SPEC.md (A2-A13).
### strict-limits-deadband-direct-inf
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 30
s 2 10
s 3 30.5
s 4 28
s 5 27.9
s 6 9
s 7 12
s 8 40
s 9 5
s 10 inf
s 11 -inf
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@3:30.500
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@5:27.900
LOW TO_LOW@6:9.000
LOW
HIGH TO_HIGH@8:40.000
LOW TO_LOW@9:5.000
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:inf
LOW TO_LOW@11:-inf
