### fault-and-recovery
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=100
init 0
s 10 35
sf 20 33
s 30 nan
s 40 36
tick 139
tick 140
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@20:33.000
FAULT
HIGH TO_NORMAL@40:36.000 TO_HIGH@40:36.000
HIGH
HIGH ESCALATE@140:36.000
